PROVEX patch 06-eval-all-attacks
Queues for graph_4_5..graph_4_13 (plus per-window loss statistics); evaluation of all four CADETS E3 attacks (window-level GT: the upstream 04-06 windows, interval overlap for 04-11/12/13) with per-day, overall and per-attack metrics plus the upstream protocol in detection_metrics.json, and alerts.json / windows.json, all in <artifact_dir>[seed_<n>/].
Series: upstream ProvenanceAnalytics/kairos@0e0b633beb46a1117c0a6d63be5d2481b59ac0dc DARPA/CADETS_E3, patches 01..11 applied in numeric order.
Paths are relative to DARPA/CADETS_E3: apply to a copy of kairos/upstream/ that is outside any git work tree (git apply <patch>), or from the repository root with git apply --directory=<copy dir> <patch>.

